---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-03 - Link Google Account
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant G as Google Identity
    participant C as AuthController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant V as IGoogleTokenValidator
    participant J as IJwtTokenGenerator
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    U->>W: Open link from the email (token)
    W->>G: Sign in with Google
    G-->>W: Google ID token
    W->>C: POST /api/Auth/link-google {token, idToken, deviceInfo}
    C->>S: LinkGoogleAccountAsync(request)
    S->>V: Validate ID token
    V-->>S: GoogleUserInfo (googleId, email)
    S->>R: Find account by token hash
    R->>DB: SELECT ACCOUNTS
    DB-->>R: account
    alt token unknown or expired, email differs, or Google account already linked
        S-->>C: ValidationException
        C-->>W: 400 Bad Request
    else valid
        S->>S: Set googleId, linkStatus = linked, clear token
        S->>R: PrepareCreate Session (device, expires in 1 month)
        S->>R: SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: UPDATE ACCOUNTS, INSERT SESSIONS
        S->>J: Generate JWT (accountId, sessionId, roles)
        J-->>S: token
        S-->>C: LoginResponse (token, roles, hasPassword = false)
        C-->>W: 200 OK
        W-->>U: Account setup step: set a password or skip
    end
